      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Exhausted after a sleepless night listening to Rodion cough and snore, Kostya corners Nastya in the morning and suggests it is time for their guest to return to the street. Outraged by Kostya's lack of compassion, Nastya declares that if Kostya kicks Rodion out, she will pack her bags and leave with him.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Вообще-то я не сплю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
